00:36:26.860 --> 00:36:29.730
We will be heading to Yokosuka City, Yokohama City, and Yokohama City on the coast of Tokyo Bay.

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:33.010
Please evacuate to the local area as soon as possible.

00:36:33.010 --> 00:36:36.010
There's a traffic jam on the road.

00:36:36.010 --> 00:36:39.010
You can't evacuate by car, so please be careful.

00:36:39.010 --> 00:36:41.010
What are you talking about?

00:36:41.010 --> 00:36:42.010
What are you doing?

00:36:42.010 --> 00:36:44.010
Hurry up and go!

00:36:54.720 --> 00:36:56.980
Everyone, please get ready.

00:36:56.980 --> 00:36:58.960
Hey, everyone, gather around.

00:36:58.960 --> 00:36:59.700
Let's go.

00:37:15.290 --> 00:37:16.040
Happy, hurry up.

00:38:34.280 --> 00:38:35.830
I'm a man.

00:39:00.160 --> 00:39:04.540
"Defense from the city. Wait until you hear the other side's name."

00:39:04.540 --> 00:39:08.130
"Fire shoot-out complete. Rise."

00:39:08.130 --> 00:39:10.690
"3rd unit, depart from the bomb area."

00:39:31.760 --> 00:39:32.760
Fire!

00:39:32.760 --> 00:39:41.940
Attack at once while pushing!

00:39:41.940 --> 00:39:43.890
Roger!

00:40:03.770 --> 00:40:04.970
He's escaped.

00:40:04.970 --> 00:40:06.050
Yashiro!

00:40:06.050 --> 00:40:07.630
It's over!

00:40:07.630 --> 00:40:09.510
Absolute Zero, standby.

00:40:36.080 --> 00:40:37.190
What's wrong?

00:40:37.190 --> 00:40:41.940
I can't react at all!

00:40:41.940 --> 00:40:47.060
There seems to be some kind of problem with the system.

00:40:47.060 --> 00:40:50.290
When a person's life is at stake...

00:41:01.600 --> 00:41:03.600
We're going to be gone...

00:41:03.600 --> 00:41:08.510
Signal detected. Kiryu. Disconnecting radio communication.

00:41:08.510 --> 00:41:10.590
Yashiro. How's Kiryu?

00:41:10.590 --> 00:41:13.580
Unable to operate at the moment.

00:41:13.580 --> 00:41:15.840
That's enough. Carry her to the dock.

00:41:15.840 --> 00:41:16.750
Roger.

00:41:16.750 --> 00:41:18.800
Roger.

00:41:19.750 --> 00:41:29.640
Yashiro!

00:41:30.990 --> 00:41:31.960
What are you doing?

00:42:06.140 --> 00:42:25.640
It's Godzilla.

00:42:30.700 --> 00:42:32.660
Wait for me at the site until you see him.

00:42:32.660 --> 00:42:34.610
What is Kiyotai doing?

00:42:34.610 --> 00:42:39.160
Captain, I'm going to drag Kiryu to the sea.

00:42:39.160 --> 00:42:40.240
Can you do it?

00:42:40.240 --> 00:42:41.480
Leave it to me.

00:43:03.260 --> 00:43:05.060
Follow me properly!

00:44:29.340 --> 00:44:30.000
I don't think so.

00:44:30.380 --> 00:44:31.720
He should be able to move more randomly.

00:44:31.720 --> 00:44:34.700
I see. Kiryu has recognized the enemy as his enemy.

00:44:34.700 --> 00:44:38.000
Release the lock and use the Absolute Zero.

00:44:38.000 --> 00:44:40.640
Is there no way to stop the rampage?

00:44:40.640 --> 00:44:45.620
We have to wait until Kiryu uses up all his energy.

00:44:45.620 --> 00:44:47.320
How long will it take?

00:44:47.320 --> 00:44:52.530
Approximately one hour.

00:44:52.530 --> 00:44:55.440
We've received a request.

00:45:03.290 --> 00:45:03.780
.

00:46:23.360 --> 00:46:27.420
After that, where's Godzilla?

00:46:27.420 --> 00:46:29.440
We're trying our best to find him.

00:46:39.530 --> 00:46:44.640
I have all the responsibility.

00:46:44.640 --> 00:46:46.640
I was the one who initiated the project.

00:46:46.640 --> 00:46:51.620
Are you going to be the Prime Minister?

00:46:51.620 --> 00:46:58.350
Everyone in the research institute is focused on the restoration of the Kiryu.

00:46:58.350 --> 00:46:59.700
What about the Kiryu team?

00:47:00.440 --> 00:47:02.260
I can't say anything now.

00:47:02.260 --> 00:47:10.210
In the first place, if the fact that you created a tornado with Godzilla's bones is the cause of calling Godzilla...

00:47:10.210 --> 00:47:28.900
The control system is down.

00:47:30.920 --> 00:47:31.830
What was that?

00:47:31.830 --> 00:47:51.220
- Give me the data. - What?

00:48:13.050 --> 00:48:16.390
Godzilla's voice interfered with Mechagodzilla's system.

00:48:16.390 --> 00:48:25.240
Can we use Kinryu now?

00:48:25.240 --> 00:48:26.990
Of course.

00:48:26.990 --> 00:48:30.000
Now, we can use the DNA computer

00:48:30.280 --> 00:48:33.560
We're using Godzilla's DNA to solve the problem of adaptability.

00:48:34.140 --> 00:48:37.740
But we're changing that DNA to the one used in the job interview.

00:48:37.900 --> 00:48:40.310
We're using a completely different DNA.

00:48:40.850 --> 00:48:43.760
If we do that, we'll never get Godzilla's attention.

00:48:44.780 --> 00:48:45.720
Please.

00:48:47.870 --> 00:48:51.830
But there might not be a Mechagodzilla anymore.

00:48:53.350 --> 00:48:59.060
No, we can only defeat Godzilla with Kiryu.

00:49:02.040 --> 00:49:05.940
Alright! I'll do my best for Akane-san!

00:49:05.940 --> 00:49:12.000
That was a bit too much.

00:49:12.000 --> 00:49:17.250
Oh, I'm glad the both of you are alright.

00:49:17.250 --> 00:49:18.520
It wasn't a big injury.

00:49:18.520 --> 00:49:21.030
You did something too much.

00:49:21.030 --> 00:49:25.480
I thought you had something on your mind, but I was wrong.

00:49:25.480 --> 00:49:27.400
It's not that bad, right?

00:49:27.400 --> 00:49:29.690
We...

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:51.910
Yamashiro saved my life.

00:49:51.910 --> 00:49:57.250
That's strange.

00:49:57.250 --> 00:49:59.190
Is it Yashiro? Or Godzilla?

00:50:00.410 --> 00:50:01.990
It's not time to be friends.

00:50:30.160 --> 00:50:33.020
So you were here.

00:50:33.020 --> 00:50:37.370
This kid is really alive.

00:50:37.370 --> 00:50:45.040
I'm wondering why he has to fight with his friend, Godzilla.

00:50:45.040 --> 00:50:54.190
He gave birth to Godzilla and now he's Godzilla's cyborg.

00:50:54.190 --> 00:50:58.420
The worst thing about him is that he's human.

00:51:02.330 --> 00:51:05.190
I understand what you're trying to say, but...

00:51:05.190 --> 00:51:07.270
I don't understand!

00:51:07.270 --> 00:51:14.280
Adults say that life is precious, but that's not the truth.

00:51:14.280 --> 00:51:18.980
No one would feel sorry for this child, right?

00:51:18.980 --> 00:51:28.000
Come on! Don't be so nervous.

00:51:30.060 --> 00:51:33.520
When my mother died, she was four years old.

00:51:33.520 --> 00:51:37.690
During her pregnancy, her liver suddenly deteriorated.

00:51:37.690 --> 00:51:43.330
The doctor said that only one life would be saved, mother or child.

00:51:43.330 --> 00:51:48.890
I asked him to save my wife's life.

00:51:48.890 --> 00:51:53.740
My wife wished that the baby's stomach would be saved.

00:51:53.740 --> 00:51:57.010
Sara said she didn't want to save both.

00:52:00.990 --> 00:52:06.860
Both of us were taken to Heaven.

00:52:06.860 --> 00:52:09.370
And then...

00:52:09.370 --> 00:52:13.160
The one who became the most sensitive to life was...

00:52:30.960 --> 00:52:33.760
What do you talk about with your mother every day?

00:52:33.760 --> 00:52:39.580
It has nothing to do with you, right?

00:52:39.580 --> 00:52:42.710
You're just running away from it.

00:52:42.710 --> 00:52:50.350
People have no choice but to move forward even if they're scared.

00:52:50.350 --> 00:52:52.290
What's that?

00:52:52.290 --> 00:52:55.440
Don't decide on your own.

00:52:55.440 --> 00:52:58.930
Fight and fight to get where you belong.

00:53:00.220 --> 00:53:02.280
That's how I've lived.

00:53:02.280 --> 00:53:05.450
Who are you fighting with?

00:53:05.450 --> 00:53:07.500
Everything in the world.

00:53:07.500 --> 00:53:15.790
That's right. Kiryu is alive.

00:53:15.790 --> 00:53:17.940
He's the same age as me.

00:53:17.940 --> 00:53:20.160
He's a life you can't ask for.

00:53:20.160 --> 00:53:26.090
A life you can't ask for?

00:53:26.090 --> 00:53:28.200
He's been born.

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:31.600
It was a life I shouldn't have lived.

00:53:32.660 --> 00:53:33.460
Why?

00:53:34.800 --> 00:53:36.600
It's fine just to live.

00:53:37.180 --> 00:53:40.530
There's no such thing as a life you shouldn't have lived.

00:53:40.630 --> 00:53:46.540
There's no such thing.

00:54:27.390 --> 00:54:27.910
But...

00:54:30.730 --> 00:54:32.020
What about Godzilla?

00:54:32.020 --> 00:54:40.020
I think he's still in the gold mine.

00:55:35.500 --> 00:55:36.530
I entered the game.

00:57:23.360 --> 00:57:25.060
The operation is complete.

00:57:25.060 --> 00:57:28.550
What is the order from the Prime Minister?

00:57:30.250 --> 00:57:31.470
Not yet.

00:57:31.470 --> 00:57:34.500
Even a normal weapon wouldn't make a difference.

00:57:34.500 --> 00:57:35.990
What the hell are they doing?

00:57:35.990 --> 00:57:38.480
They're just increasing the number of victims.

00:57:38.480 --> 00:57:41.000
All units, stun mode 40%.

00:57:41.000 --> 00:57:44.890
Defense line, start attack.

00:57:44.890 --> 00:57:53.460
At the central command post of Ichigaya,

00:57:53.460 --> 00:57:57.240
a battle tank is already waiting for us.

00:57:57.240 --> 00:57:59.480
What about the special, first-class battle tank?

00:58:00.350 --> 00:58:02.950
To Kiryu's command room.

00:58:02.950 --> 00:58:14.760
Has the Prime Minister given you permission to go to Kiryu?

00:58:14.760 --> 00:58:22.920
The restoration is complete. There will be no more riots.

00:58:22.920 --> 00:58:24.580
How can you say that?

00:58:24.580 --> 00:58:28.870
The special forces are on the line.

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:31.280
It's our duty.

00:58:31.280 --> 00:58:38.030
All right.

00:58:38.030 --> 00:58:44.600
I'll send Kiryu.

00:58:44.600 --> 00:58:50.730
Kiryu is the only hope left in our country.

00:58:51.500 --> 00:58:53.110
I'll take full responsibility.

00:59:00.160 --> 00:59:03.620
I'm waiting for you in Ryu's command room.

00:59:03.620 --> 00:59:18.640
How's the time?

00:59:18.640 --> 00:59:21.480
I'll meet you at the scene.

00:59:30.250 --> 00:59:31.190
Kiryu, dispatch!

00:59:31.980 --> 00:59:33.650
Captain Ooi, Kiryu.

01:00:21.980 --> 01:00:22.600
I think so.

01:00:31.120 --> 01:00:32.120
I'm sorry.

01:00:32.120 --> 01:00:42.170
Shinagawa East Hospital is currently evacuating.

01:00:42.170 --> 01:00:45.170
The number of people is low. It will take another 20 minutes.

01:00:45.170 --> 01:00:47.250
The car is in the middle of the line.

01:00:47.250 --> 01:00:49.150
This way!

01:00:51.540 --> 01:00:56.810
The next one is close.

01:01:19.870 --> 01:01:20.900
I'll cut it off in the air.

01:02:39.210 --> 01:02:40.440
San Shiki Kiryu.

01:03:10.940 --> 01:03:12.500
Yashiro, you can go now.

01:03:12.500 --> 01:03:13.280
Roger.

01:05:01.500 --> 01:05:02.310
I'm fine.

01:07:08.410 --> 01:07:11.140
What are you talking about?

01:08:53.100 --> 01:08:55.430
It's impossible for it to last longer than this.

01:08:55.430 --> 01:09:00.000
It has the power to charge, and 45% of Kiryu's energy is gone.

01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:02.270
Have you finished?

01:09:02.270 --> 01:09:03.770
I have to do something about this.

01:09:04.380 --> 01:09:07.260
Understood.

01:09:07.260 --> 01:09:09.080
Yashiro!

01:09:09.080 --> 01:09:11.390
Absolute Zero, stand by!

01:09:11.390 --> 01:09:16.640
Absolute Zero, stand by!

01:09:16.640 --> 01:09:17.660
Elimination.

01:09:24.540 --> 01:09:25.540
Zero, launch!

01:09:58.960 --> 01:09:59.890
In that heat...

01:10:00.090 --> 01:10:02.210
The remote control system has been destroyed.

01:10:02.210 --> 01:10:04.330
What should we do?

01:10:04.330 --> 01:10:07.740
If the remote control is not working,

01:10:07.740 --> 01:10:10.450
there are several maintenance booths in Kiryu.

01:10:10.450 --> 01:10:12.510
Can we move it manually from there?

01:10:12.510 --> 01:10:13.250
That's it.

01:10:13.250 --> 01:10:15.460
What are you talking about? It's too dangerous.

01:10:15.460 --> 01:10:19.040
There is a possibility that Godzilla has been contaminated with a poison.

01:10:19.040 --> 01:10:20.960
Captain, let me do it.

01:10:20.960 --> 01:10:23.560
I'm ready.

01:10:23.560 --> 01:10:24.440
No!

01:10:24.440 --> 01:10:25.760
I'm going down.

01:10:25.760 --> 01:10:27.090
Wait!

01:10:27.090 --> 01:10:29.100
Who told you to move?

01:10:29.100 --> 01:10:29.920
Youki!

01:10:30.510 --> 01:10:31.440
We're not going to let you escape!

01:10:31.440 --> 01:10:44.060
Be careful.

01:10:44.060 --> 01:10:52.310
The main servicemen on site will attract Godzilla.

01:10:52.310 --> 01:10:54.170
Spend as much time as possible.

01:10:54.170 --> 01:10:55.170
Energy supply situation.

01:10:55.170 --> 01:10:58.080
I'm doing my best, but I can't do it with just the Self-Defense Force's power.

01:10:58.080 --> 01:11:00.000
Then ask the power company.

01:11:00.160 --> 01:11:02.620
Can't we get the power for the general household here?

01:11:02.620 --> 01:11:05.080
If we do that, the whole of Gantou will be power outage.

01:11:05.980 --> 01:11:06.760
Let's do it.

01:11:06.760 --> 01:11:11.460
Let's contact the power company as soon as possible.

01:12:40.400 --> 01:12:44.340
- 15-16, power outage. - 17-18, power outage.

01:13:00.600 --> 01:13:01.190
Kiryu...

01:14:02.940 --> 01:14:04.120
But the energy level is...

01:14:04.120 --> 01:14:04.970
I know.

01:14:04.970 --> 01:14:05.890
I'll send it now.

01:14:05.890 --> 01:14:08.810
Micro-weapon, fire!

01:14:11.660 --> 01:14:15.680
Micro-weapon received.

01:14:15.680 --> 01:14:17.090
Target locked on.

01:14:17.090 --> 01:14:18.880
Fire!

01:14:31.340 --> 01:14:40.540
Kiryu, I'm sure you know that you and I are friends.

01:14:40.540 --> 01:14:46.550
Now, let's get going.

01:14:46.550 --> 01:14:47.630
Okay!

01:14:47.630 --> 01:14:48.500
Kiryu, start!

01:17:30.220 --> 01:17:30.900
I can't open it!

01:20:17.370 --> 01:20:23.630
Absolute terror damaged by the car. No power left. Godzilla is not able to follow.

01:20:23.630 --> 01:20:29.600
Well done.

01:20:30.190 --> 01:20:34.600
"Yashiro Akane"

01:20:34.600 --> 01:20:39.380
"Kiryu Kaiju-kun"

01:20:39.380 --> 01:20:40.420
"Prepare for departure"

01:20:40.420 --> 01:20:44.790
"Yashiro"

01:20:44.790 --> 01:20:49.450
"Wait for me at the station"

01:20:49.450 --> 01:20:50.200
"37"

01:21:01.240 --> 01:21:03.720
In the sense that we were able to defeat Godzilla like this...

01:21:03.720 --> 01:21:10.190
We have the power to defeat Godzilla.

01:21:10.190 --> 01:21:13.840
That has a great meaning.

01:21:13.840 --> 01:21:16.290
The sacrifice we made is definitely not small, but...

01:21:16.290 --> 01:21:20.710
This is our victory.

01:21:20.710 --> 01:21:25.700
That's right.

01:21:33.200 --> 01:21:33.840
Sir.

01:22:00.030 --> 01:22:00.480
in the

01:26:36.400 --> 01:26:38.930
The staff has gathered in the first desk.

01:26:49.590 --> 01:26:55.150
Thank you.

01:26:55.790 --> 01:26:56.500
For what?

01:27:01.400 --> 01:27:05.370
I've got your help.

01:27:05.370 --> 01:27:11.840
I got help from everyone.

01:27:11.840 --> 01:27:15.360
There's no life you can't live.

01:27:15.360 --> 01:27:23.360
I'll try to believe your words.

01:27:23.360 --> 01:27:24.900
Where's Nemuri-san?

01:27:31.530 --> 01:27:33.800
That's right. I was betting.

01:27:33.800 --> 01:27:37.990
I have to treat you to the celebration of Kiryu's victory.

01:27:37.990 --> 01:27:40.730
That's not a win.

01:27:40.730 --> 01:27:44.060
There's no competition.

01:27:44.060 --> 01:27:50.840
In the case of a draw, I promised to treat you.
